      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LA STIAVA (9) lightly raced filly starting to hit her straps. Made it two wins from her three starts back with a game victory over 900m at Queanbeyan as favourite. Can keep the momentum going in this tougher race. BOMBAY BOOM (1) raced without luck in town in his first two runs back, then dropped in class with a slick on pace win over 1000m at Corowa. Shapes as the main danger from the rails draw. BLUE AKOYA (3) first run for the new yard she closed strongly for a sound second over 1000m at Corowa in this class. Comes to hand quickly and has genuine prospects. DIVAZOU (4) drops in trip second up and the claim helps from the awkward gate. Will roll forward and can grip on late.",
